@ClientesAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:7178

### GET todos los clientes
GET {{ClientesAPI_HostAddress}}/api/clientes
Accept: application/json

###

### GET cliente por ID
GET {{ClientesAPI_HostAddress}}/api/clientes/1
Accept: application/json

###

### POST nuevo cliente
POST {{ClientesAPI_HostAddress}}/api/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cui": "4567890123404",
  "nit": "4567890-1",
  "nombres": "Ana Lucia",
  "apellidos": "Martinez Gomez",
  "direccion": "Amatitlan, Guatemala",
  "telefono": "55554567",
  "fechaNacimiento": "1992-03-18"
}

###

### PUT actualizar cliente 4
PUT {{ClientesAPI_HostAddress}}/api/clientes/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idCliente": 4,
  "cui": "4567890123404",
  "nit": "4567890-1",
  "nombres": "Ana Lucia",
  "apellidos": "Martinez Gomez",
  "direccion": "Villa Nueva, Guatemala",
  "telefono": "55559999",
  "fechaNacimiento": "1992-03-18"
}

###

### DELETE cliente 5
DELETE {{ClientesAPI_HostAddress}}/api/clientes/5